    <h2 class="section-title">Coaches’ <em>FAQ</em></h2>
  </div>
  <div class="faq">
<details><summary>How many ICF CCEs does TRE™ Module 1 carry?</summary><div class="a"><p>21 ICF Continuing Coach Education units: 16 in Resource Development and 5 in Core Competencies.</p></div></details>
<details><summary>Do I have to be a coach to join?</summary><div class="a"><p>No. Module 1 is open to anyone. The CCEs are a bonus for ICF-credentialed coaches who want them to count towards credential renewal.</p></div></details>
<details><summary>After Module 1, can I use TRE™ with my coaching clients?</summary><div class="a"><p>Module 1 qualifies you to use TRE™ for your own personal practice. To offer TRE™ to clients you complete Modules 2 and 3 and become a Certified Global TRE™ Provider.</p></div></details>
<details><summary>Do Modules 2 and 3 also carry CCEs?</summary><div class="a"><p>CCEs for Module 2 are pending confirmation. We will update this page as soon as they are approved.</p></div></details>
<details><summary>Is the training in English?</summary><div class="a"><p>Yes. All HummingBeing TRE™ trainings are delivered in English.</p></div></details>
</div>
